  "question": "Business Requirements Description:\nThis database is for an HR (Human Resources) Management System used within an organization. The system can:\n1.Manage Department Information: Add, delete, and modify department details, including department ID, name, and description.\n2.Manage Role Information: Add, delete, and modify roles within departments, including role name and salary. Each department can have multiple roles, and each role can exist in multiple departments.\n3.Manage Employee Information: Add, delete, and modify employee details. The system can query an employee list with detailed information, including name, role, actual salary, and department.\n4.Salary Management: Manage and modify employee salary information, including salary amount and leave status.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0314\nCREATE TABLE `department` (\n  `department_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `department_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `description` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`department_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `role` (\n  `role_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `role_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `salary` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`role_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `department_role` (\n  `department_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `role_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`department_id`,`role_id`),\n  KEY `department_role_ibfk_2` (`role_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `department_role_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`department_id`) REFERENCES `department` (`department_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `department_role_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`role_id`) REFERENCES `role` (`role_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `employee` (\n  `employee_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `employee_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `department_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `role_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `actual_salary` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `leave_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`employee_id`),\n  KEY `employee_ibfk_1` (`department_id`),\n  KEY `employee_ibfk_2` (`role_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `employee_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`department_id`) REFERENCES `department` (`department_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `employee_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`role_id`) REFERENCES `role` (`role_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
